        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.652,
            0.047,
            0.848,
            0.064
          ],
          "content": "Arithmetic Expressions"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.087,
            0.841,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": "(b) Binu earns ₹20,000 per month. She spends ₹5,000 on rent, ₹5,000 on food, and ₹2,000 on other expenses every month. What is the amount Binu will save by the end of a year?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.149,
            0.842,
            0.225
          ],
          "content": "(c) During the daytime a snail climbs 3 cm up a post, and during the night while asleep, accidentally slips down by 2 cm. The post is 10 cm high, and a delicious treat is on its top. In how many days will the snail get the treat?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.142,
            0.228,
            0.842,
            0.285
          ],
          "content": "2. Melvin reads a two-page story every day except on Tuesdays and Saturdays. How many stories would he complete reading in 8 weeks? Which of the expressions below describes this scenario?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.288,
            0.339,
            0.309
          ],
          "content": "(a) $5 \\times 2 \\times 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.311,
            0.35,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": "$( 7 - 2 ) \\times 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.337,
            0.303,
            0.356
          ],
          "content": "(c) $8 \\times 7$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.36,
            0.336,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "(d) $7 \\times 2 \\times 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.384,
            0.336,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": "$7 \\times 5 - 2$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.408,
            0.351,
            0.429
          ],
          "content": "(f) $( 7 + 2 ) \\times 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.433,
            0.367,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": "(g) $7 \\times 8 - 2 \\times 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.457,
            0.349,
            0.477
          ],
          "content": "(h) $( 7 - 5 ) \\times 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.141,
            0.481,
            0.777,
            0.503
          ],
          "content": "3. Find different ways of evaluating the following expressions:"
